nt</div>\n    <div class=\"abs dot\" style=\"left:70%; top:58%;\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"abs label strong\" style=\"left:-3%; top:65%; width:24%;\">Exclusively for students</div>\n    <div class=\"abs dot\" style=\"left:19%; top:69%;\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"abs label light\" style=\"left:58%; top:63%; width:16%;\">Balconies</div>\n    <div class=\"abs dot\" style=\"left:62%; top:68%;\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"abs label light\" style=\"left:16%; top:78%; width:24%;\">En suite shower rooms</div>\n    <div class=\"abs dot\" style=\"left:28%; top:76%;\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"abs label strong\" style=\"left:47%; top:74%; width:20%;\">FREE<br>14Mb broadband</div>\n    <div class=\"abs dot\" style=\"left:50%; top:71%;\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"abs photos\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: bright ensuite bedroom with large windows]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: group of students socializing indoors]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: bedroom with desk, wardrobe and purple wall]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"abs find-more\">Find out more info online at</div>\n  <div class=\"abs url\">www.loveiq.co.uk</div>\n  <div class=\"abs iq-locations\">iQ Shoreditch &nbsp;|&nbsp; iQ Hoxton</div>\n  <div class=\"abs footnote\">*Journey time to Old Street Tube Station as stated by tfl.gov.uk</div>\n\n  <div class=\"abs qr\" title=\"[QR code]\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
